{"resourceIdentifier":"163","resourceName":"Imudia Utilization of Coal-Mine-Methane","description":"IN THE PROJECT THAT HAS OPERATED SINCE DECEMBER 2000 THE CMM THAT IS ESCAPING FROM THE ABANDONED COAL MINE MINISTER ACHENBACH IN LUENEN-BRAMBAUER THROUGH A DEGASSING PIPELINE SHALL BE UTILIZED FOR THE GENERATION OF ENERGY IN 1 COGENERATION UNIT OF THE MAXIMUM ELECTRIC CAPACITY 4.074 KW. THE POWER PRODUCED SHALL BE FED INTO THE PUBLIC POWER GRID. BY THIS THE CONVENTIONALLY PRODUCED POWER SHALL BE ADDITIONALLY DISPLACED. IT IS PLANNED TO SUPPLY THE NEIGHBORING INDUSTRIAL ENTERPRISE TNT WITH HEAT. ALTHOUGH THE HEAT TAKE-OFF WAS FORESEEN TECHNICALLY, IT NEVER CAME TO THE ACTUAL TAKE OFF AND DELIVERY TO TNT.","location":{"latitude":51.594135,"longitude":7.431350},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":null,"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"163"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Carbon-TF B.V."},{"type":"string","value":"Cordoba, Argentina"},{"type":"string","value":"www.arcor.com.ar"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Late to verify"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"163"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"24099"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-III.D."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"TÜV NORD CERT GmbH"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"06/04/2020"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[]},{"code":"VCS_ISSUANCE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Issuance Documents","document